 maintained with monthly releases and excellent docs."},"nextSteps":[{"zh":"把设备配置放进 Git 并用 secrets.yaml 管理凭据。","en":"Keep configs in Git and credentials in secrets.yaml."}]}', 'verified', '2026-10-25T23:16:00.613Z'
